{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><i>Dysnamic</i></strong> is a story rich and character-focused visual novel with horror elements about a world with Dysnamia, an illness where symbols mark a person\u2019s cheeks and they gain abilities with awful symptoms. From permanent gems impaling your skin after you grow gemstones, to great paranoia and negative emotions affecting you after you absorb the anger or sadness of others. Bene is a man with Dysnamia trying to help with Dalflown\u2019s yearly festival, but as the week before the festival progresses, things increasingly go wrong, from accidents to disappearances, and Bene\u2019s own conflicted mindset. He\u2019s trying his best to manage his Dysnamia and help with the festival, trying to prevent everything from going wrong\u2026 but the world is not known to be kind to those with Dysnamia.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Bene is the main protagonist, with Chron and Ele as secondary protagonists. The following characters are all the main characters.<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4123470/extras/96cef51c5ad6788b9f142723f996483c.avif?t=1769806369\" width=1560 height=878 /></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4123470/extras/8660463ccab9cf6b53caecc4967a0e8d.avif?t=1769806369\" width=1560 height=878 /></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4123470/extras/d2eff014582dd88fae9883c6bfe50b84.avif?t=1769806369\" width=1560 height=878 /></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4123470/extras/b29f5e5dd6739f6952cebf3c45d10752.avif?t=1769806369\" width=1560 height=878 /></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"h